WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.761
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier and welcome to Whispers, another indie horror game for the Oculus Rift,

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:08.639
and this one actually has quite a bit of detail put into it.

00:00:08.649 --> 00:00:12.526
Not only in the art, which looks pretty nice - ah, gah, bleh, keys.

00:00:12.536 --> 00:00:15.320
What did I do? Oh, I did something, ok, there we go.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:18.713
I think my calibration just went off. What did I do to calibrate? Ah!

00:00:18.723 --> 00:00:22.686
Grabbing it - oh god, what am I doing? Uh, uh, recalibrate!

00:00:22.696 --> 00:00:25.123
[Muzak]

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:25.854
Recalibrate!

00:00:25.864 --> 00:00:27.158
[Muzak]

00:00:27.168 --> 00:00:28.666
I think I'm good now.

00:00:28.676 --> 00:00:32.865
Now that the crisis is over I'm gonna say that this game actually looks quite good,

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:40.898
and even though I got a nest of wires in front of me I'm gonna try my best not to crap my pants as I'm going through this dark and dangerous dungeon.

00:00:40.908 --> 00:00:44.827
Or dark and dangerous sewer, this seems to be. Ooh.

00:00:44.837 --> 00:00:49.402
Flashing lights and fog! How boring and droll.

00:00:49.412 --> 00:00:53.892
You're gonna have to come up with something original to scare the pants off of me.

00:00:53.902 --> 00:01:00.739
And that task might be harder than it seems because, as everyone probably knows by now I don't play games with pants on.

00:01:00.749 --> 00:01:07.536
(gasp) Hi! Uh, g - uh...I - ok. That was disturbingly normal.

00:01:07.546 --> 00:01:17.033
Hello, baby! Assuming you were a lady. Oh. Whoa. Is that something over there?

00:01:17.043 --> 00:01:20.491
Ok, I got a few things that I need to wrap my head around before we move forward.

00:01:20.501 --> 00:01:25.555
What is that? What are that? And what are over there?

00:01:25.565 --> 00:01:28.175
Hello, Mr. Skeleton dude. How you doin'?

00:01:28.185 --> 00:01:33.591
Why do you have your intestines? Oh, you have your eyeballs! That's weird, you're weird!

00:01:33.601 --> 00:01:38.210
And there's an even bigger skull over there. Ah, you're weird, I don't like you!

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:46.479
K, let's go where that lady went. Still...I still think something's over there! And I don't much care for it.

00:01:46.489 --> 00:01:53.933
Uh...man. I don't know what it is about this particular game but it seems to have quite the atmosphere.

00:01:53.943 --> 00:01:57.148
There's another dead dude. At least I hope he's dead.

00:01:57.158 --> 00:02:01.461
Don't know if he's a skeleton or what - oh! Is that another skellington?

00:02:01.471 --> 00:02:06.892
[groaning] 
That guy wasn't dead, was he! Oh. Ok!

00:02:06.902 --> 00:02:11.815
Now this game is just dicking with me! And I don't much care for things dicking with me!

00:02:11.825 --> 00:02:14.832
Hello skellington. How's it hanging?

00:02:14.842 --> 00:02:16.468
[growl] 
Ah, fuck you!

00:02:16.478 --> 00:02:21.754
Whoa, are you real? Whoa, you back off! Are you real? Are you real?

00:02:21.764 --> 00:02:25.926
Are you real, you better tell me right now, Frank! You better tell me right now!

00:02:25.936 --> 00:02:32.385
Ok. Imma assume he wasn't. Is there anything else - oh. God damn.

00:02:32.395 --> 00:02:37.270
Alright, I'll go this way. Well, so they got jump scares at me. What else do they got?

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:39.815
K, they got a wall. They got another, what is that?

00:02:39.825 --> 00:02:43.766
[croaking, unintelligible voices] 
NOO OK, I'M NOT LOOKING BEHIND ME!

00:02:43.776 --> 00:02:47.652
Oh, it is behind me, ok. God, I was more worried that there wasn't gonna be something behind me.

00:02:47.662 --> 00:02:50.635
[croaking gets louder]

00:02:50.645 --> 00:02:56.989
Ok, Grudge much? Do I still hear something? Gah.

00:02:56.999 --> 00:02:59.892
[breathing] 
Ok!

00:02:59.902 --> 00:03:05.337
This game has what a lot of games often don't, especially in the horror genre. It's good sound.

00:03:05.347 --> 00:03:13.049
Sound is good! Sound is key! I was playing...uh...GameDev simulator, whatever it was called

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:14.535
[light burns out]

00:03:14.545 --> 00:03:19.918
IIIII'm not gonna go that way. I'm gonna go this way where's there's light and stuff.

00:03:19.928 --> 00:03:24.328
Maybe this just loops back around to the other path that I didn't take before in the beginning.

00:03:24.338 --> 00:03:31.305
Ah, anyway, when I was playing GameDev simulator back...a while ago...when I would make horror games all the time.

00:03:31.315 --> 00:03:33.987
'Cause they were easy to make and sound was paramount in them.

00:03:33.997 --> 00:03:37.616
God, where am I going? I don't even know where this is anymore.

00:03:37.626 --> 00:03:43.200
Where the hell - oh, ok, that's a dead end. Uh...alright then.

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:45.565
[loud sound] 
AHH!

00:03:45.575 --> 00:03:56.177
That's a familiar horror jump scare sound! Can only get me - can only get me with that like, ten hundred more times before I start to get really angry.

00:03:56.187 --> 00:04:01.228
So which way am I supposed to go? Uh, this is a dead end too. Alrighty then!

00:04:01.238 --> 00:04:07.784
I dunno where I'm going, I dunno what I'm doing. I don't know why I'm doing it, all I know is that I'm doing it with all the best power I can!

00:04:07.794 --> 00:04:09.821
[glass breaks] 
Whazat?

00:04:09.831 --> 00:04:13.664
Excuse me? Pardon me? Wanna run that by me again?

00:04:13.674 --> 00:04:19.221
Do I hear footy footsteps behind me! Do I hear footy footsteps in front of me?

00:04:19.232 --> 00:04:24.186
Fuck your vines! What the hell? Where am I now?

00:04:24.196 --> 00:04:27.118
[scream] 
AH FUCK YOU, Jesus!

00:04:27.128 --> 00:04:29.481
[loud sound] 
Ok, another one.

00:04:29.491 --> 00:04:35.293
Well then, what is that? Oh, that's a key. Ok. I picked up a key!

00:04:35.303 --> 00:04:40.819
That's - ok. That was hard - I don't wanna know what's in the spider cobwebs over there.

00:04:40.829 --> 00:04:43.777
Uhh. Me no likey.

00:04:43.787 --> 00:04:46.213
[door creaks] 
Oh, ok. Did I use the key on that?

00:04:46.223 --> 00:04:50.861
I really don't wanna go down there but I know you guys would be remiss if I didn't. So I'm gonna go.

00:04:50.871 --> 00:04:56.400
Oh, it's a spidah! Is anybody afraid of spiders, this thing is really close to my face.

00:04:56.410 --> 00:05:03.602
Uhh. Hello, spider! With the spider phobia! Or also known as arachnophobia for non-idiots.

00:05:03.612 --> 00:05:06.549
Again! It is so behind me.

00:05:06.559 --> 00:05:12.130
So those were - I thought that were like, ghosty ectoplasmic goo that got shot all over the walls by Randy Marsh.

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:16.683
But, uh, no, it was actually spider webs, I thought I was being stupid and clever.

00:05:16.693 --> 00:05:23.165
Clever stupid. Stlever? Clupid. Whatever. I was being me.

00:05:23.175 --> 00:05:25.173
[sudden silence]

00:05:25.183 --> 00:05:29.792
Ok, I was just checking, something wasn't actually happening, it was just that...it decided that it need to stop -

00:05:29.802 --> 00:05:32.117
[loud sound]

00:05:32.127 --> 00:05:37.405
[croaking] 
Oh! Oh, Grudge much again? What am I doing now?

00:05:37.415 --> 00:05:41.872
[croaking gets louder] 
Is this where I die?

00:05:41.882 --> 00:05:48.979
Ah, that was it?! No! It was a very very short demo. God, I was just getting into it.

00:05:48.989 --> 00:05:52.877
Piss! Ok, so anyway, that was Whispers part one,

00:05:52.887 --> 00:05:56.042
they told me it was a short demo going into it, I just didn't know it was that short.

00:05:56.052 --> 00:06:02.057
But either way. There's a lot of potential here. But, I gotta say, I have to say this after playing a lot of these games...

00:06:02.067 --> 00:06:08.171
I recognize the horror sounds, they're being used over and over and over again, there needs to be some originality to it and just like,

00:06:08.181 --> 00:06:12.097
me, that I've played so many of these, I need like, something new,

00:06:12.107 --> 00:06:15.649
even though you still got me a lot with them, like I was hoping for something new.

00:06:15.659 --> 00:06:19.189
Either way, still good, lot of potential, can't wait to see the finished product.

00:06:19.199 --> 00:06:25.581
So if you enjoyed this video, leave a like down below, let me know in the comments if you got any more Oculus Rift or horror games you want me to play,

00:06:25.591 --> 00:06:30.147
and as always, I will see YOU in the next video.

00:06:30.157 --> 00:06:31.456
Bye-bye!

